# 042 · A kit self-test

**Status:** `PROPOSED` · **Version:** [v0.5.0](../roadmap.md#v050)

## What

"Try the kit" also runs known-bad and tampering candidates, and checks that the judge rejects each one.

## Why

A kit that accepts a broken candidate makes every result after it worthless.

## Done when

- [ ] Try the kit reports each bad candidate as rejected, and a weak kit fails the try.

## Decisions

None yet.

## Open questions

None.

